      "id": 1,
      "options": {
        "content": "# Monthly Cloud Cost Report\n\n- **Calendar View**: Shows cost per account per calendar month (Jan-Dec) for the current year\n- **Time Series**: Monthly cost trends over time\n- Data is delayed by 1 day.\n\n**Setup**: This dashboard uses SQL queries via PostgreSQL datasource (`GreptimeDB-Vantage-SQL`). Ensure:\n1. Vantage exporter is configured with `GREPTIMEDB_WRITE_MODE=sql`\n2. GreptimeDB PostgreSQL datasource named `GreptimeDB-Vantage-SQL` is configured in Grafana (port 4003)\n3. Database name is set to `vantage`",
        "mode": "markdown"
      },
      "type": "text"
    },
